{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24127","headline":"早春醉吟寄太原令狐相公苏州刘郎中 · 白居易","name":"早春醉吟寄太原令狐相公苏州刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪夜闲游多秉烛，花时蹔出亦提壶。\n别来少遇新诗敌，老去难逢旧饮徒。\n大振威名降北虏，勤行惠化活东吴。\n不知歌酒腾腾兴，得似河南醉尹无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}